flowchart LR
    BUG["<b>Bug Report</b><br/>Model hallucinates X"]
    ATTR["<b>Attribution</b><br/>Which tokens caused it?<br/><i>IG, SHAP, attention</i>"]
    LOC["<b>Localize</b><br/>Which layers/heads?<br/><i>Activation patching</i>"]
